{"id":"632545","name":"辣白菜","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/632545/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"姜","amount":"300g"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"200g"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"苹果","amount":"1个"},{"name":"梨","amount":"1个"},{"name":"黄米面","amount":"适量（糯米粉）"},{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"剥蒜。","img":"images/632545/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切姜。","img":"images/632545/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切苹果。","img":"images/632545/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切梨。","img":"images/632545/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把姜蒜苹果梨放破壁机打成泥。","img":"images/632545/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盛出。","img":"images/632545/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放辣椒粉鸡精盐。","img":"images/632545/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/632545/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"糯米粉加水调匀在锅里加热（我用的黄米面）。","img":"images/632545/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"调成糊状加糖拌匀。","img":"images/632545/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"把糯米糊加入前面的姜蒜糊中，酱料完成。密封放冰箱保存。","img":"images/632545/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切白菜加盐。","img":"images/632545/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"腌一宿。","img":"images/632545/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"洗干净攥出水分。。","img":"images/632545/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"取酱料和白菜拌匀。","img":"images/632545/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再加一些糖。","img":"images/632545/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/632545/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"也可以加一些韭菜。","img":"images/632545/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"三天就可以吃了。","img":"images/632545/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"一起吃辣白菜吧！","img":"images/632545/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}